{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-13-16","kind":"proposition","title":"作内接于球的正二十面体","englishTitle":"To construct an icosahedron and comprehend it in a sphere, like the aforesaid figures; and to prove that the side of the icosahedron is the irrational straight line called minor.","book":13,"number":16,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:13.prop.16","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:13.prop.16/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":16,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-13-16@raw-b0b685d2eb6585a9","contentId":"euclid-13-16","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b0b685d2eb6585a964c241aa1dfc103c54e1bafcde1b971792e6a179093031cb","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-13-16.statement","euclid-13-16.construction.1","euclid-13-16.proof.1","euclid-13-16.proof.2","euclid-13-16.proof.3","euclid-13-16.proof.4","euclid-13-16.proof.5","euclid-13-16.proof.6","euclid-13-16.proof.7","euclid-13-16.proof.8","euclid-13-16.proof.9","euclid-13-16.proof.10","euclid-13-16.proof.11","euclid-13-16.proof.12","euclid-13-16.proof.13","euclid-13-16.construction.2","euclid-13-16.proof.14","euclid-13-16.proof.15","euclid-13-16.proof.16","euclid-13-16.proof.17","euclid-13-16.proof.18","euclid-13-16.proof.19","euclid-13-16.proof.20","euclid-13-16.proof.21","euclid-13-16.proof.22","euclid-13-16.proof.23","euclid-13-16.proof.24","euclid-13-16.proof.25","euclid-13-16.proof.26","euclid-13-16.proof.27","euclid-13-16.proof.28","euclid-13-16.proof.29","euclid-13-16.proof.30","euclid-13-16.proof.31","euclid-13-16.proof.32","euclid-13-16.proof.33","euclid-13-16.proof.34","euclid-13-16.construction.3","euclid-13-16.proof.35","euclid-13-16.proof.36","euclid-13-16.proof.37","euclid-13-16.proof.38","euclid-13-16.proof.39","euclid-13-16.proof.40","euclid-13-16.proof.41","euclid-13-16.proof.42","euclid-13-16.proof.43","euclid-13-16.proof.44","euclid-13-16.proof.45","euclid-13-16.proof.46","euclid-13-16.proof.47","euclid-13-16.conclusion","euclid-13-16.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-13-16.statement","contentId":"euclid-13-16","revisionId":"euclid-13-16@raw-b0b685d2eb6585a9","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1fd22cd7745e756fd6f4a15b3b08837f4acabcb21022ab3e1f73e0dbd36ac22f","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"To construct an icosahedron and comprehend it in a sphere, like the aforesaid figures; and to prove that the side of the icosahedron is the irrational straight line called minor."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"建造一面象沙赫德龙,并把它理解在球体上,如上述数字;并证明象沙赫德龙的一侧是无理线段称为次要的。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-16.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-13-16","revisionId":"euclid-13-16@raw-b0b685d2eb6585a9","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"80db85cd88986d8c845af390fdc1918e2aad8af63058c924ce4f5c20c09c17ae","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let the diameter AB of the given sphere be set out, and let it be cut at C so that AC is quadruple of CB, let the semicircle ADB be described on AB, let the straight line CD be drawn from C at right angles to AB, and let DB be joined; let the circle EFGHK be set out and let its radius be equal to DB, let the equilateral and equiangular pentagon EFGHK be inscribed in the circle EFGHK, let the circumferences EF, FG, GH, HK, KE be bisected at the points L, M, N, O, P, and let LM, MN, NO, OP, PL, EP be joined."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"将特定球体的直径AB确定下来,将其切为C,AC是CB的四倍,将AB对ADB半圆形的描述划为AB,将CD直线从直角时的C线划为AB至AB,并将DB线连接为DB;让EFGHK圆圈的半径等于DB,让EFGHK圆圈的等边形和角形五角形EFGHK线被标为EFGHK,让EF、FG、GH、HK、KE圆圈在L、M、N、O、P点被双切,让LM、MN、NO、OP、PL、PL、EP连接。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-16.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-13-16","revisionId":"euclid-13-16@raw-b0b685d2eb6585a9","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d55ac4fbaedd1c4be724e62b33f30a98e6a790bd6af9888fcbb8484632d9d043","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the pentagon LMNOP is also equilateral, and the straight line EP belongs to a decagon."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,五角形LMNOP也是等边形,直线EP属于十角形。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-16.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-13-16","revisionId":"euclid-13-16@raw-b0b685d2eb6585a9","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"35b843f09e2817bb67e2a31fc62630b8e5ae50f3149f19d043f4f95841b13e9d","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now from the points E, F, G, H, K let the straight lines EQ, FR, GS, HT, KU be set up at right angles to the plane of the circle, and let them be equal to the radius of the circle EFGHK, let QR, RS, ST, TU, UQ, QL, LR, RM, MS, SN, NT, TO, OU, UP, PQ be joined."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"从E、F、G、H、K点开始,将EQ、FR、GS、HT、KU直线设为直角至平面个圆圈,使其等于EFGHK圈的半径,QR、RS、ST、TU、UQ、QL、LR、RM、MS、SN、NT、TO、OU、UP、PQ接通。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-16.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-13-16","revisionId":"euclid-13-16@raw-b0b685d2eb6585a9","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9dbce0fe99d801592db425048aeeb65fde7decfbe681163d4abafe0300189292","citations":["euclid-11-6"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now, since each of the straight lines EQ, KU is at right angles to the same plane, therefore EQ is parallel to KU. [[XI. 6](/principles/euclid-11-6)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,既然EQ线,KU线每条线直角到平面线,所以EQ线与KU线平行。 [[XI. 6](/principles/euclid-11-6)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-16.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-13-16","revisionId":"euclid-13-16@raw-b0b685d2eb6585a9","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2543c55d05b38fbf17e9b80cb4c2690fe8eddb26a396fb47d178beecd4d3fefc","citations":["euclid-1-33"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But it is also equal to it; and the straight lines joining those extremities of equal and parallel straight lines which are in the same direction are equal and parallel. [[I. 33](/principles/euclid-1-33)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但它也与它相等;连接相同方向的平行线的直线是平等和平行的。 [[I. 33](/principles/euclid-1-33)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-16.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-13-16","revisionId":"euclid-13-16@raw-b0b685d2eb6585a9","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"92fc6bc950a710c6c4e3b157094196feb6a7250671760a94b80ee24d5b869936","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore QU is equal and parallel to EK."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,QU是相等和平行的EK。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-16.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-13-16","revisionId":"euclid-13-16@raw-b0b685d2eb6585a9","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d0cd6a334c4142d388141376a3a00cbc33dde57e389d01d993046274cda48359","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But EK belongs to an equilateral pentagon; therefore QU also belongs to the equilateral pentagon inscribed in the circle EFGHK."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但EK属于等边五边形;因此,QU也属于EFGHK圆所标的等边五边形。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-16.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-13-16","revisionId":"euclid-13-16@raw-b0b685d2eb6585a9","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ccf3be72e1ad5eec7067de868dfc86a42666bead9857a07518216721c4813a5b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For the same reason each of the straight lines QR, RS, ST, TU also belongs to the equilateral pentagon inscribed in the circle EFGHK; therefore the pentagon QRSTU is equilateral."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"出于同样的原因,QR、RS、ST、TU等直线都属于EFGHK圆所标的等边形;因此,五边QRSTU是等边形。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-16.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-13-16","revisionId":"euclid-13-16@raw-b0b685d2eb6585a9","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8267743f30b20c312409bba34b77b9de2395bd662056ebbdc029834906b253fc","citations":["euclid-13-10"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since QE belongs to a hexagon, and EP to a decagon, and the angle QEP is right, therefore QP belongs to a pentagon; for the square on the side of the pentagon is equal to the square on the side of the hexagon and the square on the side of the decagon inscribed in the same circle. [[XIII. 10](/principles/euclid-13-10)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由于QE是六边形,EP是十角形,QEP是正确角度,因此QP是五边形;由于五边的正方形等于六边形的正方形,而十边形的正方形等于同一圆内所标的九点30。 [[XIII. 10](/principles/euclid-13-10)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-16.proof.9","contentId":"euclid-13-16","revisionId":"euclid-13-16@raw-b0b685d2eb6585a9","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 9","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"642b01f371262f27e752fcdc03f62defd06dfd9a2136784b12e0373576e9de56","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For the same reason PU is also a side of a pentagon."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"出于同样的原因,PU也是五角形的一面。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-16.proof.10","contentId":"euclid-13-16","revisionId":"euclid-13-16@raw-b0b685d2eb6585a9","order":11,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 10","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"63f3154e4f2d48741a64eab759b935fe9a32e178c8e0d868519394389f72f999","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But QU also belongs to a pentagon; therefore the triangle QPU is equilateral."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但QU也是五角形的,因此三角形QPU是等边形。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-16.proof.11","contentId":"euclid-13-16","revisionId":"euclid-13-16@raw-b0b685d2eb6585a9","order":12,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 11","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"adc9a981c8741f53be6549f3170088187282a226d06bacdf0f1b6aca2abd09c4","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For the same reason each of the triangles QLR, RMS, SNT, TOU is also equilateral."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"出于同样的原因,每个三角形QLR,RMS,SNT,TOU也是等边形。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-16.proof.12","contentId":"euclid-13-16","revisionId":"euclid-13-16@raw-b0b685d2eb6585a9","order":13,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 12","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c0c24cbac83d0c5a1db1e98a35c4e01ad09c24a7bcfdb4786af44a48c8accf0a","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since each of the straight lines QL, QP was proved to belong to a pentagon, and LP also belongs to a pentagon, therefore the triangle QLP is equilateral."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"QL线QP线 被证明属于五角形 LP线也属于五角形 所以三角形QLP是等边形"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-16.proof.13","contentId":"euclid-13-16","revisionId":"euclid-13-16@raw-b0b685d2eb6585a9","order":14,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 13","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2c8befbb3f05fb5f53dbe45d2a33381459f47199ffde03743f94245370453f89","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For the same reason each of the triangles LRM, MSN, NTO, OUP is also equilateral."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"出于同样的原因,每个三角形LRM,MSN,NTO,OUP也是等边形。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-16.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-13-16","revisionId":"euclid-13-16@raw-b0b685d2eb6585a9","order":15,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d400ed855340851cad0b46fd7d415346c12a1bdb3cddf46fd9c85f35391cfd50","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let the centre of the circle EFGHK the point V, be taken; from V let VZ be set up at right angles to the plane of the circle, let it be produced in the other direction, as VX, let there be cut off VW, the side of a hexagon, and each of the straight lines VX, WZ, being sides of a decagon, and let QZ, QW, UZ, EV, LV, LX, XM be joined."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"将EFGHK圆圈的中心移到V圆圈,从直角圈的V圈到平面圈,将这一圈延伸至另一个方向,即VX圈的VW圈,将六边的VW圈和VX线的每一个线都划为10角的两边,将QZ线、QW圈的UZ圈连接到EV圈的LV圈,LX圈的XM圈。（相关点与线段：VZ、WZ）"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-16.proof.14","contentId":"euclid-13-16","revisionId":"euclid-13-16@raw-b0b685d2eb6585a9","order":16,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 14","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9d846d85459c506a8b490f2cad0f82c77af78aa2dd7eb88fbcf27cc9e1de2e67","citations":["euclid-11-6"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now, since each of the straight lines VW, QE is at right angles to the plane of the circle, therefore VW is parallel to QE. [[XI. 6](/principles/euclid-11-6)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,既然VW线,QE线每条线都位于直角到平面线,VW线与QE线平行。 [[XI. 6](/principles/euclid-11-6)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-16.proof.15","contentId":"euclid-13-16","revisionId":"euclid-13-16@raw-b0b685d2eb6585a9","order":17,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 15","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"34f6ea4288ee9576ded9741825e4b6522d0c7354276f550b153f7023055e798c","citations":["euclid-1-33"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But they are also equal; therefore EV, QW are also equal and parallel. [[I. 33](/principles/euclid-1-33)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,它们也是平等的;因此,EV,QW也是平等和平行的。 [[I. 33](/principles/euclid-1-33)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-16.proof.16","contentId":"euclid-13-16","revisionId":"euclid-13-16@raw-b0b685d2eb6585a9","order":18,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 16","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1f2d2b0b7e9d07670537c26f7c64146837df428f09ce8211e8946b85272d095a","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But EV belongs to a hexagon; therefore QW also belongs to a hexagon."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但EV属于六边形,因此QW也属于六边形。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-16.proof.17","contentId":"euclid-13-16","revisionId":"euclid-13-16@raw-b0b685d2eb6585a9","order":19,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 17","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"019cd914422dd2b584538fdcfc662febf88c73577e799cc70791bf782855d73b","citations":["euclid-13-10"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since QW belongs to a hexagon, and WZ to a decagon, and the angle QWZ is right, therefore QZ belongs to a pentagon. [[XIII. 10](/principles/euclid-13-10)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"QW属于六边形,WZ属于十边形, 角度QWZ是正确的, 所以QZ属于五边形。 [[XIII. 10](/principles/euclid-13-10)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-16.proof.18","contentId":"euclid-13-16","revisionId":"euclid-13-16@raw-b0b685d2eb6585a9","order":20,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 18","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"06fda6d9d4a46dba313dae728861721a74b141691eb9eaf266c3cdf9a7062599","citations":["euclid-4-15"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For the same reason UZ also belongs to a pentagon, inasmuch as, if we join VK, WU, they will be equal and opposite, and VK, being a radius, belongs to a hexagon; [[IV. 15, Por.](/principles/euclid-4-15)] therefore WU also belongs to a hexagon."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"出于同样的原因,UZ也属于五边形,因为如果我们连接到VK,WU就等于和对,VK半径就属于六边形;因此,WU也属于六边形。 [[IV. 15, Por.](/principles/euclid-4-15)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-16.proof.19","contentId":"euclid-13-16","revisionId":"euclid-13-16@raw-b0b685d2eb6585a9","order":21,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 19","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"eac70bf5802252837f52334d14e9f1e35749d46e7fbdbe7f2b71478b4a81ed4d","citations":["euclid-13-10"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But WZ belongs to a decagon, and the angle UWZ is right; therefore UZ belongs to a pentagon. [[XIII. 10](/principles/euclid-13-10)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但WZ是属于十角形的, 角度UWZ是正确的, 因此UZ是属于五角形的。 [[XIII. 10](/principles/euclid-13-10)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-16.proof.20","contentId":"euclid-13-16","revisionId":"euclid-13-16@raw-b0b685d2eb6585a9","order":22,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 20","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"052d151fe07db2d773468aa3ffd6b69a72b422d50d8d57a3988421bfabfab012","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But QU also belongs to a pentagon; therefore the triangle QUZ is equilateral."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但QU也是五角形的,因此三角形QUZ是等边形。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-16.proof.21","contentId":"euclid-13-16","revisionId":"euclid-13-16@raw-b0b685d2eb6585a9","order":23,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 21","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5eca3a8e3a2c356e691d58d1fd74e57f64e190a28925bbf7c8d901350c9a8667","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For the same reason each of the remaining triangles of which the straight lines QR, RS, ST, TU are the bases, and the point Z the vertex, is also equilateral."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"出于同样的原因,其余的三角形各为等离子体,其中直线QR、RS、ST、TU是底边,顶点Z也是等离子体。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-16.proof.22","contentId":"euclid-13-16","revisionId":"euclid-13-16@raw-b0b685d2eb6585a9","order":24,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 22","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d0b15c23322c9778c9b03ef3f0144831754ce91bfbf2f459835f0a4923c6a107","citations":["euclid-13-10"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Again, since VL belongs to a hexagon, and VX to a decagon, and the angle LVX is right, therefore LX belongs to a pentagon. [[XIII. 10](/principles/euclid-13-10)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"VL属于六边形,VX属于十边形,角度LVX是正确的,因此LX属于五边形。 [[XIII. 10](/principles/euclid-13-10)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-16.proof.23","contentId":"euclid-13-16","revisionId":"euclid-13-16@raw-b0b685d2eb6585a9","order":25,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 23","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b145a5fa88df05fff45782801b3b20ff6d0abb0827f4d35feb4be727297390c1","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For the same reason, if we join MV, which belongs to a hexagon, MX is also inferred to belong to a pentagon."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"出于同样的原因,如果我们连接属于六边形的MV,MX也被推断为属于五边形。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-16.proof.24","contentId":"euclid-13-16","revisionId":"euclid-13-16@raw-b0b685d2eb6585a9","order":26,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 24","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9a8d54f52ff359a8f72111f61978bcbd66448422082d1af9698904ddf77a485f","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But LM also belongs to a pentagon; therefore the triangle LMX is equilateral."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但LM也是五角形的,因此三角形LMX是等边形。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-16.proof.25","contentId":"euclid-13-16","revisionId":"euclid-13-16@raw-b0b685d2eb6585a9","order":27,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 25","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6b1fe3fad0a0343e6efe8bea6280e4d4ebc3d39830f0a706c7a447d6e40032d0","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Similarly it can be proved that each of the remaining triangles of which MN, NO, OP, PL are the bases, and the point X the vertex, is also equilateral."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,可以证明,其余的三角形中,MN、NO、OP、PL是底边个,而顶点X也是等式的。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-16.proof.26","contentId":"euclid-13-16","revisionId":"euclid-13-16@raw-b0b685d2eb6585a9","order":28,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 26","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"cd9be241f464bf466273b74af7219cb984a9df47cebb64dc6adc0d0bc88076e2","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore an icosahedron has been constructed which is contained by twenty equilateral triangles."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,已经建造了一面体,由20,等边三角形组成。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-16.proof.27","contentId":"euclid-13-16","revisionId":"euclid-13-16@raw-b0b685d2eb6585a9","order":29,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 27","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3961d73a01fb4a0e6a9a636df4c608d0a097fc8c98022460f29b58adeefe0846","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"It is next required to comprehend it in the given sphere, and to prove that the side of the icosahedron is the irrational straight line called minor."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"下一步需要理解它, 并证明 象牙面的一面是无理线段 被称为未成年人。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-16.proof.28","contentId":"euclid-13-16","revisionId":"euclid-13-16@raw-b0b685d2eb6585a9","order":30,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 28","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"98aa35195ca264cd9c45a15f27d203d157fda54a40006f478a54cf20230d68e7","citations":["euclid-13-9"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, since VW belongs to a hexagon, and WZ to a decagon, therefore VZ has been cut in extreme and mean ratio at W, and VW is its greater segment; [[XIII. 9](/principles/euclid-13-9)] therefore, as ZV is to VW, so is VW to WZ."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为VW是六边形,WZ是十边形,因此,黄金分割VWW次被削减,VW是更大的部分;因此,ZV比VW等于WZ比WZ；ZV 与 VW 之比等于 VW 与 WZ 之比。（相关点与线段：VZ） [[XIII. 9](/principles/euclid-13-9)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-16.proof.29","contentId":"euclid-13-16","revisionId":"euclid-13-16@raw-b0b685d2eb6585a9","order":31,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 29","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"abd27c6737f167a66ff335bd665510d449c24157a35cc344f0a601c0ea6bd7a1","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But VW is equal to VE, and WZ to VX; therefore, as ZV is to VE, so is EV to VX."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但VW等于VE,WZ至VX;因此,ZV至VE的比等于EV至VX的比；ZV 与 VE 之比等于 EV 与 VX 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-16.proof.30","contentId":"euclid-13-16","revisionId":"euclid-13-16@raw-b0b685d2eb6585a9","order":32,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 30","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ed4a77d44982dc35bff6e664541f2433aae46aab97cd227c55a5c3f6176bb624","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And the angles ZVE, EVX are right; therefore, if we join the straight line EZ, the angle XEZ will be right because of the similarity of the triangles XEZ, VEZ."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"角度ZVE,EVX是正确的。 因此,如果我们连接直线EZ, 角度XEZ将是正确的, 因为三角形的相似性是XEZ,VEZ。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-16.proof.31","contentId":"euclid-13-16","revisionId":"euclid-13-16@raw-b0b685d2eb6585a9","order":33,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 31","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a1837c1620b1998af02f55fb62d2f25515b4c367fe2173671a240a9b10af4622","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For the same reason, since, as ZV is to VW, so is VW to WZ, and ZV is equal to XW, and VW to WQ, therefore, as XW is to WQ, so is QW to WZ."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"出于同样的原因,ZV对VW的比等于VW对WZ的比,ZV对XW的比等于XW,VW对WQ,XW对WQ的比等于QW对WZ的比；ZV 与 VW 之比等于 VW 与 WZ 之比；XW 与 WQ 之比等于 QW 与 WZ 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-16.proof.32","contentId":"euclid-13-16","revisionId":"euclid-13-16@raw-b0b685d2eb6585a9","order":34,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 32","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9450f3589fb6445b5c69494705cdef7b0deb76cecce8d8f8f2c749f8efb5d82e","citations":["euclid-6-8","euclid-3-31"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And for this reason again, if we join QX, the angle at Q will be right; [[VI. 8](/principles/euclid-6-8)] therefore the semicircle described on XZ will also pass through Q. [[III. 31](/principles/euclid-3-31)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,如果我们连接到QX,Q的角将是正确的。 因此,XZ描述的半圆圈也将通过Q。 [[VI. 8](/principles/euclid-6-8)] [[III. 31](/principles/euclid-3-31)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-16.proof.33","contentId":"euclid-13-16","revisionId":"euclid-13-16@raw-b0b685d2eb6585a9","order":35,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 33","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ab7cc0da9f6d4d14033f2a810e55b4f9860ec846755e157a6643b2e916e8b1e7","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And if, XZ remaining fixed, the semicircle be carried round and restored to the same position from which it began to be moved, it will also pass through Q and the remaining angular points of the icosahedron, and the icosahedron will have been comprehended in a sphere."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果XZ剩余固定,半圆圈被绕过,并恢复到开始移动的位置,它也将通过Q,而象沙赫德龙的其余角点将被一个球体所理解。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-16.proof.34","contentId":"euclid-13-16","revisionId":"euclid-13-16@raw-b0b685d2eb6585a9","order":36,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 34","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"48129c2fdbd648738aa04af8ef7c560d83ca3db1d9f3df0d0ff9a046400bc19a","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"I say next that it is also comprehended in the given sphere."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"接下来我说,它也体现在特定领域。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-16.construction.3","contentId":"euclid-13-16","revisionId":"euclid-13-16@raw-b0b685d2eb6585a9","order":37,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"28f722c6651cbe83c4be9fec9ded5f4da4887d3f533603da9be11f5c4035f57d","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let VW be bisected at A'."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"VW在A被拆分"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-16.proof.35","contentId":"euclid-13-16","revisionId":"euclid-13-16@raw-b0b685d2eb6585a9","order":38,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 35","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"39303c490d7451d5a240c75f4def714704dafe73e45fe17ba8feb33d081caf01","citations":["euclid-13-3"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Then, since the straight line VZ has been cut in extreme and mean ratio at W, and ZW is its lesser segment, therefore the square on ZW added to the half of the greater segment, that is WA', is five times the square on the half of the greater segment; [[XIII. 3](/principles/euclid-13-3)] therefore the square on ZA' is five times the square on ."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"之后,由于直线 VZVZ在黄金分割时被削减为W,ZW是其较小的部分,因此,在较大的数量部分中,即WA增加的第正方形是大数量部分中第正方形的5倍;因此,第ZA正方形是第正方形的5倍。 [[XIII. 3](/principles/euclid-13-3)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-16.proof.36","contentId":"euclid-13-16","revisionId":"euclid-13-16@raw-b0b685d2eb6585a9","order":39,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 36","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"07ae42c5709cc682d5425bb5e24c750b25448c78ee3b23e14de7984bbe9dfc78","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And ZX is double of ZA', and VW double of ; therefore the square on ZX is five times the square on WV."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"ZX是ZA的两倍,VW是ZX的两倍。 因此,ZX的正方形是WV的正方形的5倍。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-16.proof.37","contentId":"euclid-13-16","revisionId":"euclid-13-16@raw-b0b685d2eb6585a9","order":40,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 37","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"37c920eb0a6440c8c6919a8a93e000e11d179ff1eac8a30d12e2ff12bb261382","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since AC is quadruple of CB, therefore AB is five times BC."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AC是CB的三倍 所以AB是BC的5倍"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-16.proof.38","contentId":"euclid-13-16","revisionId":"euclid-13-16@raw-b0b685d2eb6585a9","order":41,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 38","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"620b3bc36f39cf9b7b5bb91868f718b1b3b748cd6d7b2a37e1e43f4bbfc1a73f","citations":["euclid-6-8","euclid-5-def-9"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, as AB is to BC, so is the square on AB to the square on BD; [[VI. 8](/principles/euclid-6-8), [V. Def. 9](/principles/euclid-5-def-9)] therefore the square on AB is five times the square on BD."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,AB对BC的比等于AB对正方形的比,BD对正方形的比,因此,AB对正方形的比是BD对正方形的5倍 [ [VI. 8](/principles/euclid-6-8) [V. Def. 9](/principles/euclid-5-def-9)"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-16.proof.39","contentId":"euclid-13-16","revisionId":"euclid-13-16@raw-b0b685d2eb6585a9","order":42,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 39","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"72d3a6aba7528eb62313b2c6a3fb91aa810e95d10e1346f0ef98e63ab33b2055","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the square on ZX was also proved to be five times the square on VW."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但ZX正方形也证明是VW正方形的五倍"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-16.proof.40","contentId":"euclid-13-16","revisionId":"euclid-13-16@raw-b0b685d2eb6585a9","order":43,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 40","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6f0e3549c1cdb3142e71db95dfa880bb8b45075497adb53c5562038bbbe220a1","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And DB is equal to VW, for each of them is equal to the radius of the circle EFGHK; therefore AB is also equal to XZ."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"DB等于VW, 每一个等于EFGHK圆的半径, 因此AB也等于XZ。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-16.proof.41","contentId":"euclid-13-16","revisionId":"euclid-13-16@raw-b0b685d2eb6585a9","order":44,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 41","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"bf4cfbd7f4d211b1c8c934d1376961d982daf60f952e5b0a930f1ba77827f45b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And AB is the diameter of the given sphere; therefore XZ is also equal to the diameter of the given sphere."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AB是给定球的直径, 因此XZ 也等于给定球的直径。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-16.proof.42","contentId":"euclid-13-16","revisionId":"euclid-13-16@raw-b0b685d2eb6585a9","order":45,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 42","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"88599fea52e972c3118ac8abf1ea4f2f382472cd53be8d906f79ed33e046d073","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the icosahedron has been comprehended in the given sphere"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此, 象牙体已经被 理解在特定领域"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-16.proof.43","contentId":"euclid-13-16","revisionId":"euclid-13-16@raw-b0b685d2eb6585a9","order":46,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 43","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"cc6c59a710e0556a82134c283c0111fe7ef216f57d978e9393e6070057b87128","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"I say next that the side of the icosahedron is the irrational straight line called minor."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"下一位是九百三十号"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-16.proof.44","contentId":"euclid-13-16","revisionId":"euclid-13-16@raw-b0b685d2eb6585a9","order":47,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 44","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a165c6869dac76e2ee8d79e5cbc475eb702979a0c0150157a2439ae90091eca7","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, since the diameter of the sphere is rational, and the square on it is five times the square on the radius of the circle EFGHK, therefore the radius of the circle EFGHK is also rational; hence its diameter is also rational."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为球的直径是有理,正方形是EFGHK圆半径的正方形的5倍,因此EFGHK圆的半径也是有理;因此其直径也是有理。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-16.proof.45","contentId":"euclid-13-16","revisionId":"euclid-13-16@raw-b0b685d2eb6585a9","order":48,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 45","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1242ea8aa0ce440e5a0843557145499b0714a09b06fb9f20746f633ebb043127","citations":["euclid-13-11"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, if an equilateral pentagon be inscribed in a circle which has its diameter rational, the side of the pentagon is the irrational straight line called minor. [[XIII. 11](/principles/euclid-13-11)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,如果在直径为有理的圆形中刻上等边形五角形,则五角形的侧面是无理线段个称为次要的。 [[XIII. 11](/principles/euclid-13-11)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-16.proof.46","contentId":"euclid-13-16","revisionId":"euclid-13-16@raw-b0b685d2eb6585a9","order":49,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 46","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8332ddf843f626ff3fcc76f79a62a883fd3d2d8409338ed88d5c0c4901744335","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And the side of the pentagon EFGHK is the side of the icosahedron."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"五角EFGHK的侧面是 面板的侧面。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-16.proof.47","contentId":"euclid-13-16","revisionId":"euclid-13-16@raw-b0b685d2eb6585a9","order":50,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 47","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3eca0c963df5698d1b4ddadb66097aab7638446b28cd03166379236d325850ae","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the side of the icosahedron is the irrational straight line called minor."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,象牙面的一面是无理线段,叫做未成年人。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-16.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-13-16","revisionId":"euclid-13-16@raw-b0b685d2eb6585a9","order":51,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"767826504056e982b9220e28ac41aa4922e6dbedd348ff4c17eaa828608a6aef","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Porism. From this it is manifest that the square on the diameter of the sphere is five times the square on the radius of the circle from which the icosahedron has been described, and that the diameter of the sphere is composed of the side of the hexagon and two of the sides of the decagon inscribed in the same circle. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"质谱。 从这一点可以看出,球的直径为正方形,是圆的5倍,而圆的半径是象沙赫德龙所描述的圆的正方形,球的直径是由六角和同一圆内刻的十角两边组成的。 证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-16.source","contentId":"euclid-13-16","revisionId":"euclid-13-16@raw-b0b685d2eb6585a9","order":52,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"fee8ec3430a94c02892d05e7af8144a6d69d1f1d14f6241261bad56615c9b12d","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:13.prop.16/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:13.prop.16\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-13-16:euclid-11-6:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-13-16","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-13-16.proof.3","euclid-13-16.proof.14"],"targetContentId":"euclid-11-6","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:13.prop.16","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:13.prop.16/","sourceLabel":"XI. 6"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-13-16:euclid-1-33:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-13-16","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-13-16.proof.4","euclid-13-16.proof.15"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-33","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:13.prop.16","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekL